<title>PHILIPPINES: Ayala Corp sets three ctv cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Ayala Corp sets three ctv cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine conglomerate Ayala Corp had declared a three centavo cash dividend for its shareholders as of December 27, the Philippine Stock Exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid out on January 24 next year. Ayala had paid a three centavo interim dividend to shareholders in July.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
